From a57ac0a71e31439ee976ba05f50854350c4df454 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jianying Lang <langjian@amazon.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:20:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] vllm_neuron: trn3 spec-decode slot mapping, gang prefill
 scheduling, profiler options from env

- spec_decode_correction: row index_select + gather instead of a flat req * max_blocks + n index,
  which fails neuronx-cc on trn3 (NCC_ILSM901) in every decode graph of a spec-decode server.
- scheduler: gang prefill (HY3_PREFILL_GANG, off): hold arriving prefills up to HY3_GANG_MAX_WAIT_S and
  run them back to back, so running decodes stall fewer times per request. Merged with the admission
  guard, livelock backoff and preemption changes; KV admission override via VLLM_NEURON_MAX_KV_CONCURRENT.
- neuron_profiler: options from $VLLM_NEURON_PROFILER_JSON (additional_config is in vLLM's compile hash).
- neuron_worker: HY3_IO_RING_CACHE sets the NEURON_RT_IO_RING_CACHE_SIZE default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
